    "correcao": "Toque as vozes internas mais suavemente e compare uma gravação.",
    "criterio": "Três repetições contínuas do trecho com melodia reconhecível.",
    "fontes": [
      {
        "caminhoLocal": "Curso Kaiser\\Repertório Nível 1\\1. Repertório Nível 1\\30. Estudo n.5 em Si menor (Fernando Sor) - Violão Clássico\\1. Aula.en.vtt",
        "titulo": "1. Aula.en.vtt",
        "tipo": "legenda"
      },
      {
        "caminhoLocal": "Curso Kaiser\\Repertório Nível 1\\1. Repertório Nível 1\\30. Estudo n.5 em Si menor (Fernando Sor) - Violão Clássico\\1. Aula.mp4",
        "titulo": "1. Aula.mp4",
        "tipo": "video"
      },
      {
        "caminhoLocal": "Curso Kaiser\\Repertório Nível 1\\1. Repertório Nível 1\\30. Estudo n.5 em Si menor (Fernando Sor) - Violão Clássico\\descricao.md",
        "titulo": "descricao.md",
        "tipo": "descricao"
      }
    ],
    "legendas": [
      {
        "caminhoLocal": "Curso Kaiser\\Repertório Nível 1\\1. Repertório Nível 1\\30. Estudo n.5 em Si menor (Fernando Sor) - Violão Clássico\\1. Aula.en.vtt",
        "trechos": [
          {
            "tempo": "00:02:53.980",
            "texto": "Hello folks."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:02:54.860",
            "texto": "Let's learn this study by F. Sor,"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:02:58.500",
            "texto": "which is a very important piece for the guitar repertoire."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:01.960",
            "texto": "As with all videos, the tablature and the music sheet are attached."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:07.600",
            "texto": "And now I'm going to play it very slowly so that you pay close attention"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:12.440",
            "texto": "in the movements of both hands."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:15.240",
            "texto": "And I'll also take some breaks to explain some details."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:19.280",
            "texto": "So let's get started."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:55.300",
            "texto": "That was the first part."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:57.340",
            "texto": "Then we'll repeat the first part up to a certain point."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:05.780",
            "texto": "For now everything is the same."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:10.560",
            "texto": "And now a G."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:38.980",
            "texto": "Okay."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:40.340",
            "texto": "And now the third part."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:42.820",
            "texto": "This song seems repetitive, but has some tricky parts."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:46.820",
            "texto": "I show you how the third part is done. Starting from the end of the second part."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:54.980",
            "texto": "At this point, this B cannot continue to sound."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:59.420",
            "texto": "So I mute it placing my right hand thumb on the 5th string."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:05:24.300",
            "texto": "And now a tricky part."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:05:45.720",
            "texto": "I'll repeat this passage, starting from the end of the second part, so that you can get this tricky part."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:31.020",
            "texto": "And now the 4th part, starting from the end of the previous one."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:36.400",
            "texto": "Then we sustain this F#,"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:39.780",
            "texto": "and I already form the next chord, B7."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:07:22.360",
            "texto": "Then we'll repeat the entire first part."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:07:44.340",
            "texto": "And then, when we get to F#, it will be different."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:07:58.200",
            "texto": "And now the closure."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:08:01.220",
            "texto": "Note that the fingering will be slightly different."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:08:41.060",
            "texto": "See that I'm using these three strings."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:08:44.700",
            "texto": "Look at the image of my right hand."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:08:48.600",
            "texto": "So it will be like this."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:08:51.300",
            "texto": "The song practically ends here, with just one more repetition of the 3rd part."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:09:00.140",
            "texto": "Remember that the transition from the 2nd to the 3rd part is like this."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:09:14.240",
            "texto": "Right? And that's how we'll enter the 3rd part again."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:09:17.780",
            "texto": "If you get a little confused, take a look at the music sheet and the tablature,"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:09:24.720",
            "texto": "because there you'll find the double bar line, which is a bar that indicates repetition."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:09:29.760",
            "texto": "So there is a double bar line at the end, and there is also one of those in the middle of the song."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:09:37.380",
            "texto": "That is, this entire passage between the two bars will be repeated."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:09:40.840",
            "texto": "So read the attached file and also watch me playing at the beginning of this video,"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:09:47.000",
            "texto": "in my little recital."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:09:50.540",
            "texto": "So, to end this class with a recommendation,"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:09:57.220",
            "texto": "I tell you to try to play this song with the cleanest sound possible."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:10:03.100",
            "texto": "And also let the notes sound."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:10:04.760",
            "texto": "That is, as the song is simple, we can strive to get a clean and resonant sound."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:10:08.980",
            "texto": "And we do that by correctly position the fingers and sustaining them up, so that the notes continue to sound"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:10:15.180",
            "texto": "which generates this very beautiful effect."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:10:19.760",
            "texto": "This is the secret of this song. Okay?"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:10:22.440",
            "texto": "So enjoy your studies and I see you next time."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:10:25.600",
            "texto": "Bye!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
