    "legendas": [
      {
        "caminhoLocal": "Curso Kaiser\\Repertório Nível 2\\1. Repertório Nível 2\\22. Gente Humilde (Garoto) - MPB\\1. Aula.en.vtt",
        "trechos": [
          {
            "tempo": "00:00:59.940",
            "texto": "In this video we're going to learn \"Gente Humilde\", by Garoto,"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:03.040",
            "texto": "one of the greatest Brazilian guitarists of all time."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:06.120",
            "texto": "He greatly influenced the following generations,"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:09.080",
            "texto": "the Bossa Nova music."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:10.760",
            "texto": "It's a pity that he died so young, but still left an incredible repertoire."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:15.240",
            "texto": "This song requires a lot of sentimentality and dynamism from us."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:20.860",
            "texto": "We can't play this song in a square way, like this."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:30.480",
            "texto": "Got it? It cannot be like that."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:31.760",
            "texto": "It should sound like this."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:40.880",
            "texto": "Did you notice the difference? Listen to those vibratto."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:43.900",
            "texto": "So let's get started."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:45.340",
            "texto": "I'll play it slowly and in the meantime pay attention to the tablature"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:50.440",
            "texto": "and to the frets that I'll be working with."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:01:53.100",
            "texto": "The tablature and images of my both hands will be visible for you to observe."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:02:12.900",
            "texto": "\"Slide\"."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:02:24.960",
            "texto": "See again how I played."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:02:36.640",
            "texto": "Moving on."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:02:38.860",
            "texto": "Look at this."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:02:41.240",
            "texto": "A \"pull-off\"."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:02:52.160",
            "texto": "\"Diminished chord\"."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:09.980",
            "texto": "Then it goes back to the beggining. But this time, this A9"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:15.160",
            "texto": "in practice it will be an A/C#. So the chord will look like this."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:24.620",
            "texto": "We'll use our index finger to play this \"slide\"."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:46.220",
            "texto": "Look at this \"mordent\"."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:51.300",
            "texto": "\"Harmonic\"."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:03:52.880",
            "texto": "Watch again."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:17.680",
            "texto": "See what this chord is like."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:21.020",
            "texto": "Again."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:37.900",
            "texto": "And now a series of quick shifts."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:46.220",
            "texto": "Right?"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:04:57.140",
            "texto": "And then we'll play this \"harmonic\", placing the right hand on this part of the guitar."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:05:02.880",
            "texto": "Right in the soundhole, towards the bridge."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:05:07.480",
            "texto": "We'll lay the index finger right here and then will play it like this."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:05:15.140",
            "texto": "It is a \"harmonic\" in this region."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:05:17.920",
            "texto": "So we'll play it by laying the index finger and pulling with middle finger."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:05:26.800",
            "texto": "So to recap."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:05:43.360",
            "texto": "This song can be repeated twice,"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:05:45.440",
            "texto": "and in the second time we could play it with some variations."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:05:48.880",
            "texto": "In this video I played it only once because it was enough to transmit the energy of the music."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:05:56.060",
            "texto": "I recommend that you look for other great guitarists playing this song."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:02.240",
            "texto": "For example, Paulinho Nogueira and Baden Powell,"
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:05.900",
            "texto": "who made arrangements for this song."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:08.240",
            "texto": "Paulo Belinatti also, who is a great promoter of Garoto's work."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:12.440",
            "texto": "These versions are possibly in other musical tones."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:16.840",
            "texto": "So keep that in mind and listen them carefully."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:20.840",
            "texto": "Listen to my version too, which is the one you'll use to learn it."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:25.100",
            "texto": "And remember to put all your feelings into playing it."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:28.520",
            "texto": "And you should listen to the sung versions that are also wonderful."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:33.440",
            "texto": "The versions by Maria Bethânia and Chico Buarque I recommend."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:36.260",
            "texto": "So that's it, folks."
          },
          {
            "tempo": "00:06:37.860",
            "texto": "Enjoy your studies!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
